              "headline": "Niacinamide (Vitamin B3)",
              "body": "Fades dark spots and post-blemish marks noticeably over 4–8 weeks. Works differently to acids or vitamin C — specifically targets the delivery of pigment rather than production, so it complements rather than competes with other brightening actives. Niacinamide inhibits the transfer of melanosomes…."
